---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: "help_of(&format!(\"{line} -h\"))"
---
Read and write comment threads.

USAGE
  holst comment <command> [flags]

COMMANDS
  ls:          List the board's threads and when each was read
  add:         Start a comment thread
  reply:       Reply in a thread
  resolve:     Resolve a thread, or reopen it
  edit:        Colour a thread or move it
  rm:          Delete a thread with its replies, or one reply
  read:        Mark a thread as read

EXAMPLES
  $ holst comment ls "Roadmap"
  $ holst comment add "Roadmap" "Is this final?" --object a1b2c3d4
